You can order a taxi in all major cities of Cyprus with our app. Order a transfer to the airport of Larnaca and Paphos. Download the app and get a in a few clicks!
Why choose us?
• You know the cost before a trip;
• The app will detect your location even if you don't know the exact address;
• You can make a pre-order for a fixed time;
• You can pay for your trip with a credit card;
• You can see available cars close to you;
* Track the movement of the car in real time;
* The app shows detailed information about the driver and the car;
• History of orders. Repeat order. Return trip.
 
How to make an order in the Alfa app:
* Download the app and register
• Link your credit card to the app for your convenience
• Make an order using the map or the name of the hotel
* Track the movement of the car in real time
• Enjoy your ride
We make trips in Cyprus simple, comfortable and affordable

Caronte & Tourist App: arrange your trips by sea to Sicily, Campania, and the islands surrounding Sicily quickly and with ease.

Thanks to the app you can organize your trips. Moreover, our multi-route booking allows you to plan the trip you desire.

Thanks to the app you can:
- book your routes by drawing a line between your starting point and your destination with your finger thanks to the innovative “tactile booking”;
- register the data of the passengers you usually travel with for an even faster booking;
- buy your tickets and self-check-in with no need to go to the ticket office;
- check in real-time the updates on the routes through "Notices" section;
- look at the timetables of the routes offered by the fleet of the Caronte & Tourist Group and find the nearest port you can depart from;

Download it to your smartphone!

For more information visit the official website https://carontetourist.it/en
